  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0b0a74c8e89850e4aa2aaf511f6e08b6, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: Caw! ...Ahem. My deepest apologies. Sometimes the old instincts take flight
      before my manners do.
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: 'Welcome, Spirit... to the end of the line. '
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: Or is it the beginning? It all depends on which way the scales are tipping
      today, eh?
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: 'I am Ferry-Feather. I specialize in... delicate logistics. '
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: You see those lively fish you've got? Those aren't dinner, my friend.
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: Those are souls... fishy little spirits waiting for their next big adventure
      in the Great Pond Beyond.
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: But alas! A trout with no wings cannot fly to its reincarnation. And that...
      is where I cawme in.
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: "And since you\u2019ve done such a great job plucking them from the depths...
      I believe a bit of coin is in order for you."
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: I promise I found it feather and square!
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: "It\u2019s a fair eggchange, wouldn't you say? No need to feel gullty about
      taking my coin!"
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: 'So, what say you? Shall we help these slippery souls find their way home... '
  - characterName: Ferry-Feather
    text: Or are you just going to let them get freezer burn?
  isQuestion: 0
